      "text": "- Trip\n    - id\n    - rideId\n    - driverId\n    - startedtime\n    - status. // STARTED , FINISHED\n    \n    \n- TripPayment\n    - id\n    - tripId\n    - price\n    - paymentstatus //  PENDING, FAILED,\nSUCCESS\n\n- VehcleCatory\n    - id\n    - type // TAXI, BIKE...\n\n- Userlocation\n    - userid\n    - long\n    - lat\n    - updatedtime",
      "fontSize": 20,
