    {
      "id": "YlnXecmNWKbJ96WW8_vvK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14275.069124227,
      "y": 1254.0292197351273,
      "width": 1294.9591064453125,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2081717354,
      "version": 2260,
      "versionNonce": 1840326634,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "s71B88ZBGy5r2mIheG722",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1752200884122,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution for nearby driver\n\n-> Geohash maintain of driver.\n-> maintain the list of driver in one above geohash in sorted set redis.\n-> location update -> remove and add. -> take care by redis with high reliability like master replica and aof. \n-> now a days it is also done by redis, find the nearby with distance.\n\n\nFlows:\n- user tell about source and destination\n- rider service call the ETA service and it will tell the pricing and time for all vehicle type.\n- send to rider and also save this as fare object in db.\n- rider select one -> request to backend server for ride creation. and it return rideId for polling.\n- call the matching service.\n    - it find the nearby driver with source location geohash with helop of location service.\n    - select out of them as per some algorithm, or order\n    - it call notifcation service for sendign notifcation fo dricer one by one and add lock on that driver.\n        - driver accept\n            - bascially it will send request to ride server to start trip.\n            - backend server create the trip and update ride status. \n            - also update the driver status to unavailable.\n            - driver get tripId in response and redirect to trip page. \n            - one user get to know update about the ride. it fetch the trip for that ride.\n            - and redirect to that page.\n        - driver deny\n            -  \n- one both redirect to the trip management page, then will send websocket connection to trip managemtn service.\n- and both will share their location and that will be exchange by tripmangement service. to see on map. \n- after reach destination, finished call by driver -> update the trip to sucees, trip payment to pending payment and ride to complete\n- and reditect to payment paze. \n \n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solution for nearby driver\n\n-> Geohash maintain of driver.\n-> maintain the list of driver in one above geohash in sorted set redis.\n-> location update -> remove and add. -> take care by redis with high reliability like master replica and aof. \n-> now a days it is also done by redis, find the nearby with distance.\n\n\nFlows:\n- user tell about source and destination\n- rider service call the ETA service and it will tell the pricing and time for all vehicle type.\n- send to rider and also save this as fare object in db.\n- rider select one -> request to backend server for ride creation. and it return rideId for polling.\n- call the matching service.\n    - it find the nearby driver with source location geohash with helop of location service.\n    - select out of them as per some algorithm, or order\n    - it call notifcation service for sendign notifcation fo dricer one by one and add lock on that driver.\n        - driver accept\n            - bascially it will send request to ride server to start trip.\n            - backend server create the trip and update ride status. \n            - also update the driver status to unavailable.\n            - driver get tripId in response and redirect to trip page. \n            - one user get to know update about the ride. it fetch the trip for that ride.\n            - and redirect to that page.\n        - driver deny\n            -  \n- one both redirect to the trip management page, then will send websocket connection to trip managemtn service.\n- and both will share their location and that will be exchange by tripmangement service. to see on map. \n- after reach destination, finished call by driver -> update the trip to sucees, trip payment to pending payment and ride to complete\n- and reditect to payment paze. \n \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
