      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752200259546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for me better solution looks to make engine as async\n\nride -> matching sync\nresponsibility of matchin can be break\n\nlike it will send events to kafka\n\nfor notification and execution and distributed locking.\n\nmatching just find driver for ride and tell to worker by kafka\nwhich is stateless. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for me better solution looks to make engine as async\n\nride -> matching sync\nresponsibility of matchin can be break\n\nlike it will send events to kafka\n\nfor notification and execution and distributed locking.\n\nmatching just find driver for ride and tell to worker by kafka\nwhich is stateless. ",
